#: .\models.py:125 .\models.py:690
#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\inventory.html:83
#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\inventory.html:107
#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:75
#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:142
#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:179
#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:279
#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:314
#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\test_console.html:48
msgid "Key set"
msgstr "Set ng mga key"

#: .\models.py:127
msgid ""
"A key set is one silo adapter and one key store. Fields that name the same "
"set share its keys, and the settings choose the adapter and the key store."
msgstr ""
"Ang set ng mga key ay isang silo adapter at isang key store. Ang mga field "
"na pareho ang pinangalanang set ay nagbabahagi ng mga key nito, at ang mga "
"setting ang nagtatakda ng adapter at ng key store."

#: .\models.py:134 .\models.py:701
#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\dataencryptionkey\purge_confirm.html:90
#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\dataencryptionkey\schedule_confirm.html:42
#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\dataencryptionkey\schedule_confirm.html:124
#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:73
#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:141
#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:177
#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:278
#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:313
msgid "Silo UID"
msgstr "Silo UID"

#: .\models.py:135
msgid ""
"The silo adapter sets this identifier, and no two silos of one key set share "
"one."
msgstr ""
"Itinatakda ng silo adapter ang identifier na ito, at walang dalawang silo ng "
"iisang set ng mga key na may parehong identifier."

#: .\models.py:143
msgid ""
"This says what the key does: it encrypts model fields, encrypts stored "
"files, or computes a blind index. The admin test console uses keys of its "
"own."
msgstr ""
"Sinasabi nito kung ano ang ginagawa ng key: nag-e-encrypt ito ng mga model "
"field, nag-e-encrypt ng mga nakaimbak na file, o nagko-compute ng blind "
"index. May sariling mga key ang admin test console."

#: .\models.py:149
msgid "Silo label"
msgstr "Label ng silo"

#: .\models.py:150
msgid "The silo adapter names its silos with this label."
msgstr ""
"Ito ang label na ginagamit ng silo adapter sa pagpapangalan ng mga silo "
"nito."

#: .\models.py:157
msgid ""
"The key encryption key encrypts this data encryption key, and only the "
"encrypted form is stored. Deleting the key clears it."
msgstr ""
"Ine-encrypt ng key encryption key ang data encryption key na ito, at ang "
"naka-encrypt na anyo lamang ang itinatabi. Nawawala ito kapag binura ang key."

#: .\models.py:166
msgid "This key encryption key encrypts the data encryption key."
msgstr "Ine-encrypt ng key encryption key na ito ang data encryption key."

#: .\models.py:172 .\models.py:395 .\models.py:744
msgid "KEK key version"
msgstr "Bersyon ng KEK key"

#: .\models.py:174
msgid ""
"The KMS reported this version of the key encryption key when it encrypted "
"the data encryption key. Some providers need it to decrypt, and the rest "
"keep it for reference. It is empty where the provider reports no version."
msgstr ""
"Iniulat ng KMS ang bersyong ito ng key encryption key nang i-encrypt nito "
"ang data encryption key. Kailangan ito ng ilang provider para mag-decrypt, "
"at itinatago naman ito ng iba para sa sanggunian. Walang laman ito kung saan "
"walang iniuulat na bersyon ang provider."

#: .\models.py:185
msgid ""
"This crypto backend, such as 'tink' or 'cryptography', generated the data "
"encryption key. The application checks it when it loads the key, so a "
"different backend never loads it. It is empty for a blind index key."
msgstr ""
"Ang crypto backend na ito, gaya ng 'tink' o 'cryptography', ang gumawa ng "
"data encryption key. Sinusuri ito ng application kapag nilo-load ang key, "
"kaya hindi ito kailanman nilo-load ng ibang backend. Walang laman ito para "
"sa isang blind index key."

#: .\models.py:194 .\models.py:764
#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\inventory.html:110
#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\inventory.html:147
msgid "Algorithm"
msgstr "Algorithm"

#: .\models.py:196
msgid ""
"The crypto backend generated the data encryption key for this algorithm, "
"such as 'AES256_GCM', and names it in its own terms."
msgstr ""
"Ginawa ng crypto backend ang data encryption key para sa algorithm na ito, "
"gaya ng 'AES256_GCM', at pinangangalanan ito sa sarili nitong mga termino."

#: .\models.py:202
msgid "Encrypted key writes"
msgstr "Bilang ng pagsulat ng naka-encrypt na key"

#: .\models.py:204
msgid ""
"The application adds one each time it writes new encrypted key material to "
"this row: when a key encryption key re-encrypts the same key, or when a "
"rotation replaces it."
msgstr ""
"Nagdaragdag ang application ng isa sa tuwing may bagong naka-encrypt na key "
"material na isinusulat sa row na ito: kapag muling ine-encrypt ng isang key "
"encryption key ang parehong key, o kapag pinalitan ito ng isang rotation."

#: .\models.py:210
msgid "DEK key version"
msgstr "Bersyon ng DEK key"

#: .\models.py:212
msgid ""
"The application counts the generations of this key's material: 1 for the "
"first key, then one more for each rotation. Unlike the key encryption key "
"version, it is not a provider identifier. Unlike the count of encrypted key "
"writes, it does not change when another key encryption key re-encrypts the "
"same material."
msgstr ""
"Binibilang ng application ang mga henerasyon ng material ng key na ito: 1 "
"para sa unang key, at isa pa sa bawat rotation. Hindi ito identifier ng "
"provider, hindi tulad ng bersyon ng key encryption key. Hindi ito nagbabago "
"kapag muling ine-encrypt ng ibang key encryption key ang parehong material, "
"hindi tulad ng bilang ng pagsulat ng naka-encrypt na key."

#: .\models.py:223 .\models.py:345
#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\inventory.html:60
#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:84
#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:182
#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:232
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Katayuan"

#: .\models.py:224 .\models.py:346
msgid ""
"The application derives the key's current status from its key lifecycle "
"events."
msgstr ""
"Hinahango ng application ang kasalukuyang katayuan ng key mula sa mga key "
"lifecycle event nito."

#: .\models.py:229 .\models.py:351
#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\dataencryptionkey\purge_confirm.html:94
#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:184
msgid "Undeletable until"
msgstr "Hindi mabubura hanggang"

#: .\models.py:231 .\models.py:353
msgid ""
"The application's deletion window ends at this time. Nothing can destroy the "
"key before then; after it, deleting the key may destroy it. The key can be "
"restored until it is actually deleted."
msgstr ""
"Nagtatapos sa oras na ito ang window ng pagtanggal ng application. Walang "
"makakasira sa key bago ito; pagkatapos nito, maaaring sirain ng pagtanggal "
"sa key. Maaaring ibalik ang key hanggang sa tunay itong matanggal."

#: .\models.py:240
msgid ""
"Reconcile sets this when no live silo matches the key's silo UID. It is for "
"display only: every action that destroys a key checks again before it acts."
msgstr ""
"Itinatakda ito ng reconcile kapag walang aktibong silo na tumutugma sa silo "
"UID ng key. Pantanaw lamang ito: bago kumilos ang bawat aksyong sumisira ng "
"key, muli itong sinusuri."

#: .\models.py:247
msgid "Key material last generated at"
msgstr "Huling nabuo ang key material noong"

#: .\models.py:249
msgid ""
"The key material now in use was generated at this time. A data encryption "
"key's cryptoperiod counts from here, not from the row's creation date, which "
"a revived key keeps from its first life. Re-encrypting the key onto another "
"key encryption key does not change it, because the material stays the same."
msgstr ""
"Nabuo ang key material na ginagamit ngayon sa oras na ito. Dito "
"nagsisimulang bilangin ang cryptoperiod ng isang data encryption key, hindi "
"sa petsa ng paggawa ng row, na pinananatili ng isang binuhay na key mula sa "
"unang buhay nito. Hindi ito nagbabago kapag muling ine-encrypt ang key tungo "
"sa ibang key encryption key, dahil nananatiling pareho ang material."

#: .\models.py:258
msgid "Last re-encrypted at"
msgstr "Huling muling na-encrypt noong"

#: .\models.py:260
msgid ""
"Its key encryption key last re-encrypted this data encryption key at this "
"time. Rotating a key encryption key protects nothing already stored until "
"this re-encryption runs, so a key encryption key's cryptoperiod counts "
"against this time, not against the rotation."
msgstr ""
"Huling muling ine-encrypt ng key encryption key nito ang data encryption key "
"na ito sa oras na ito. Walang naiingatan ang pag-rotate ng key encryption "
"key sa mga naka-imbak nang data hangga't hindi naisasagawa ang muling pag-"
"encrypt na ito, kaya ang cryptoperiod ng isang key encryption key ay "
"binibilang mula sa oras na ito, hindi mula sa rotation."

#: .\models.py:265 .\models.py:406
msgid "Created at"
msgstr "Nilikha noong"

#: .\models.py:266 .\models.py:407
msgid "Updated at"
msgstr "Na-update noong"

#: .\models.py:271 .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\inventory.html:31
#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\inventory.html:103
msgid "Data encryption keys"
msgstr "Mga data encryption key"

#: .\models.py:324
msgid "Silo-exclusive — eligible for deleting"
msgstr "Silo-exclusive — kuwalipikado para sa pagbura"

#: .\models.py:325
msgid "Shared/opaque — never auto-deleted"
msgstr "Nakabahagi/opaque — hindi kailanman awtomatikong binura"

#: .\models.py:333
msgid ""
"This key store holds the key encryption key. The name is a block in the "
"KMS_KEY_STORES setting."
msgstr ""
"Hawak ng key store na ito ang key encryption key. Ang pangalan ay isang "
"block sa setting na KMS_KEY_STORES."

#: .\models.py:338
msgid "The KMS knows this key encryption key by this full resource name."
msgstr ""
"Kilala ng KMS ang key encryption key na ito sa buong pangalan ng resource na "
"ito."

#: .\models.py:361
msgid "KMS deletion at"
msgstr "Pagbura sa KMS noong"

#: .\models.py:363
msgid ""
"The provider destroys the key at this time. The application sets it when it "
"asks the provider to delete the key, or when it finds a deletion already "
"under way. Only the provider can cancel the deletion; this application "
"cannot."
msgstr ""
"Sinisira ng provider ang key sa oras na ito. Itinatakda ito ng application "
"kapag hiniling nito sa provider na tanggalin ang key, o kapag natuklasan "
"nitong may nagaganap nang pagtanggal. Ang provider lamang ang makakakansela "
"ng pagtanggal; hindi ito magagawa ng application na ito."

#: .\models.py:373
#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\keyencryptionkey\schedule_confirm.html:122
msgid "Disposition"
msgstr "Disposisyon"

#: .\models.py:375
msgid ""
"This says whether the key encryption key could be deleted when it was "
"scheduled for deletion. Wherever a data encryption key still names the key, "
"the deletion works this out again from the running configuration and uses "
"that answer instead."
msgstr ""
"Sinasabi nito kung puwedeng tanggalin ang key encryption key nang i-iskedyul "
"ang pagtanggal nito. Saanman may data encryption key na nagpapangalan pa rin "
"sa key, muling kinukuwenta ng pagtanggal ito mula sa kasalukuyang "
"configuration at ginagamit ang sagot na iyon sa halip."

#: .\models.py:384
msgid "Owner prefix"
msgstr "Prefix ng owner"

#: .\models.py:386
msgid ""
"This prefix marked the key as this application's when it was scheduled for "
"deletion. It stays empty until then, and the application refuses to delete "
"the key if the current prefix no longer matches."
msgstr ""
"Minarkahan ng prefix na ito ang key bilang pag-aari ng application na ito "
"nang i-iskedyul ang pagtanggal nito. Mananatili itong walang laman hanggang "
"noon, at tatanggi ang application na tanggalin ang key kung hindi na tugma "
"ang kasalukuyang prefix."

#: .\models.py:396
msgid ""
"The KMS last reported this version of the key encryption key as current."
msgstr ""
"Huling iniulat ng KMS ang bersyong ito ng key encryption key bilang "
"kasalukuyan."

#: .\models.py:402
msgid ""
"Reconcile sets this when no live silo uses the key. It is for display only: "
"every action that destroys a key checks again before it acts."
msgstr ""
"Itinatakda ito ng reconcile kapag walang aktibong silo na gumagamit sa key. "
"Pantanaw lamang ito: bago kumilos ang bawat aksyong sumisira ng key, muli "
"itong sinusuri."

#: .\models.py:412 .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\inventory.html:30
#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\inventory.html:55
msgid "Key encryption keys"
msgstr "Mga key encryption key"

#: .\models.py:505
msgid "Recorded IP address"
msgstr "Naitalang IP address"

#: .\models.py:506
msgid "Recorded IP addresses"
msgstr "Mga naitalang IP address"

#: .\models.py:545
msgid "Recorded OS user"
msgstr "Naitalang OS user"

#: .\models.py:546
msgid "Recorded OS users"
msgstr "Mga naitalang OS user"

#: .\models.py:662
msgid "This names what happened to the key."
msgstr "Pinangangalanan nito kung ano ang nangyari sa key."

#: .\models.py:672
msgid ""
"The event is about this key encryption key. It is empty when the event is "
"about a data encryption key."
msgstr ""
"Tungkol sa key encryption key na ito ang event. Walang laman ito kapag "
"tungkol sa data encryption key ang event."

#: .\models.py:683
msgid ""
"The event is about this data encryption key. It is empty when the event is "
"about a key encryption key."
msgstr ""
"Tungkol sa data encryption key na ito ang event. Walang laman ito kapag "
"tungkol sa key encryption key ang event."

#: .\models.py:692
msgid ""
"At the time of this event, the key belonged to this key set. It is empty for "
"a key encryption key that is shared or belongs to no silo."
msgstr ""
"Sa oras ng event na ito, nabibilang ang key sa set ng mga key na ito. Walang "
"laman ito para sa key encryption key na shared o walang silo."

#: .\models.py:703
msgid ""
"At the time of this event, the key belonged to this silo. It is empty for a "
"key encryption key that is shared or belongs to no silo."
msgstr ""
"Sa oras ng event na ito, nabibilang ang key sa silo na ito. Walang laman ito "
"para sa key encryption key na shared o walang silo."

#: .\models.py:712
msgid ""
"At the time of this event, the key encryption key involved had this resource "
"name."
msgstr ""
"Sa oras ng event na ito, ito ang pangalan ng resource ng kasangkot na key "
"encryption key."

#: .\models.py:726
msgid ""
"At the time of this event, this key encryption key encrypted the data "
"encryption key. It is empty on a key encryption key's own events."
msgstr ""
"Sa oras ng event na ito, ine-encrypt ng key encryption key na ito ang data "
"encryption key. Walang laman ito sa mga sariling event ng isang key "
"encryption key."

#: .\models.py:736
msgid ""
"At the time of this event, this key store held the key encryption key. It is "
"empty on a key encryption key's own events."
msgstr ""
"Sa oras ng event na ito, hawak ng key store na ito ang key encryption key. "
"Walang laman ito sa mga sariling event ng isang key encryption key."

#: .\models.py:746
msgid ""
"At the time of this event, the KMS reported this version of the key "
"encryption key. It is empty where the provider reports no version."
msgstr ""
"Sa oras ng event na ito, iniulat ng KMS ang bersyong ito ng key encryption "
"key. Walang laman ito kung saan walang iniuulat na bersyon ang provider."

#: .\models.py:756
msgid ""
"At the time of this event, the data encryption key came from this crypto "
"backend. It is empty for a blind index key and on a key encryption key's own "
"events."
msgstr ""
"Sa oras ng event na ito, nagmula ang data encryption key sa crypto backend "
"na ito. Walang laman ito para sa isang blind index key at sa mga sariling "
"event ng isang key encryption key."

#: .\models.py:766
msgid ""
"At the time of this event, the data encryption key was generated for this "
"algorithm. It is empty on a key encryption key's own events."
msgstr ""
"Sa oras ng event na ito, ginawa ang data encryption key para sa algorithm na "
"ito. Walang laman ito sa mga sariling event ng isang key encryption key."

#: .\models.py:776
msgid ""
"This says how the event came about: someone asked for it, it followed from "
"another act, or a script or schedule ran it."
msgstr ""
"Sinasabi nito kung paano nangyari ang event: hiniling ito ng isang tao, "
"sumunod ito sa ibang gawain, o pinatakbo ito ng isang script o iskedyul."

#: .\models.py:786
msgid "This says why the event happened, where the event alone does not."
msgstr ""
"Sinasabi nito kung bakit nangyari ang event, kapag hindi ito sinasabi ng "
"event lamang."

#: .\models.py:791
msgid "Effective at"
msgstr "Epektibo noong"

#: .\models.py:793
msgid ""
"The event set this deletion date, where it set one: the end of the "
"application's window for a scheduling event, or the provider's date for a "
"requested deletion."
msgstr ""
"Itinakda ng event ang petsa ng pagtanggal na ito, kung may itinakda ito: ang "
"katapusan ng window ng application para sa isang event ng pag-iiskedyul, o "
"ang petsa ng provider para sa hiniling na pagtanggal."

#: .\models.py:811
msgid ""
"This user acted, where the configuration records one. The reference stays "
"after the user is deleted."
msgstr ""
"Kumilos ang user na ito, kung may itinala ang configuration. Nananatili ang "
"reference kahit mabura ang user."

#: .\models.py:822
msgid "OS login account"
msgstr "OS login account"

#: .\models.py:824
msgid ""
"A command-line act ran under this operating-system account, shown with its "
"uid, where the configuration records one."
msgstr ""
"Tumakbo ang isang gawain sa command line sa ilalim ng operating-system "
"account na ito, na ipinapakita kasama ang uid nito, kung may itinala ang "
"configuration."

#: .\models.py:834
msgid "User IP address"
msgstr "IP address ng user"

#: .\models.py:835
msgid "The act came from this address, where the configuration records one."
msgstr ""
"Nanggaling ang gawain sa address na ito, kung may itinala ang configuration."

#: .\models.py:837
msgid "Recorded at"
msgstr "Naitala noong"

#: .\models.py:841
msgid "Key lifecycle event"
msgstr "Key lifecycle event"

#: .\models.py:842
msgid "Key lifecycle events"
msgstr "Mga key lifecycle event"

#: .\models.py:1131
msgid "Data encryption key rotation"
msgstr "Rotation ng data encryption key"

#: .\models.py:1132
msgid "Data encryption key rotations"
msgstr "Mga rotation ng data encryption key"

#: .\models.py:1171
msgid "Data encryption key rotation work item"
msgstr "Work item ng rotation ng data encryption key"

#: .\models.py:1172
msgid "Data encryption key rotation work items"
msgstr "Mga work item ng rotation ng data encryption key"

#: .\models.py:1225
msgid "Blind index entry"
msgstr "Blind index entry"

#: .\models.py:1226
msgid "Blind index entries"
msgstr "Mga blind index entry"

#: .\models.py:1271 .\models.py:1272
msgid "Encryption tools"
msgstr "Mga tool sa pag-encrypt"

#: .\reconcile.py:63
msgid ""
"the silo adapter cannot enumerate silos, so deleted-silo (DB-side) orphans "
"cannot be detected"
msgstr ""
"hindi ma-enumerate ng silo adapter ang mga silo, kaya hindi matukoy ang mga "
"orphan mula sa binurang silo (sa panig ng DB)"

#: .\reconcile.py:66
msgid ""
"enumerating the silos failed, so deleted-silo (DB-side) orphans could not be "
"detected on this pass"
msgstr ""
"nabigo ang pag-enumerate ng mga silo, kaya hindi natukoy sa pagdaang ito ang "
