msgstr "Wala pa sa mga napiling data encryption key ang maaaring burahin."

#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\dataencryptionkey\purge_confirm.html:29
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(counter)s selected key will not be destroyed (%(reasons)s) and is not "
"listed below. Nothing about it changes, so resolving the cause and deleting "
"again works."
msgid_plural ""
"%(counter)s selected keys will not be destroyed (%(reasons)s) and are not "
"listed below. Nothing about them changes, so resolving the cause and "
"deleting again works."
msgstr[0] ""
"%(counter)s napiling susi ang hindi sisirain (%(reasons)s) at hindi "
"nakalista sa ibaba. Walang nagbabago tungkol dito, kaya gumagana ang pag-"
"aayos ng dahilan at muling pagtanggal."
msgstr[1] ""
"%(counter)s (na) napiling susi ang hindi sisirain (%(reasons)s) at hindi "
"nakalista sa ibaba. Walang nagbabago tungkol sa kanila, kaya gumagana ang "
