#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:163
msgid "Data Encryption Keys Without a Live Silo"
msgstr "Mga Data Encryption Key na Walang Buhay na Silo"

#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:165
msgid ""
"The data encryption keys below support no live silo. Those marked orphaned "
"are the actionable ones: their silo no longer exists. To remove one, select "
"it on the Data Encryption Keys page and choose \"Schedule deletion\" — this "
"starts a reversible deletion window. Once the window expires, the delete "
"action destroys the data encryption key for good."
msgstr ""
"Ang mga data encryption key sa ibaba ay walang sinusuportahang buhay na "
"silo. Ang mga markadong ulila ang dapat aksyunan: wala na ang kanilang silo. "
"Upang alisin ang isa, piliin ito sa pahinang Data Encryption Keys at piliin "
"ang “Schedule deletion” — magsisimula ito ng nababawing window ng "
"pagtanggal. Kapag natapos ang window, tuluyan nang sisirain ng aksyong "
"pagtanggal ang data encryption key."

#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:183
msgid "DEK (live)"
msgstr "DEK (live)"

#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:193
msgid "The settings do not define this key set"
msgstr "Hindi tinutukoy ng mga setting ang key set na ito"

#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:206
msgid "Go to the Data Encryption Keys page →"
msgstr "Pumunta sa pahina ng Mga data encryption key →"

#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:214
msgid "Key Encryption Keys Without a Live Silo"
msgstr "Mga Key Encryption Key na Walang Buhay na Silo"

#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:220
msgid ""
"The key encryption keys below support no live silo. Those marked orphaned "
"are the actionable ones: their data is already gone and the keys remain on "
"the KMS, costing money. To act on one, select it on the Key Encryption Keys "
"page and choose schedule deletion, restore, or record an action taken in the "
"KMS."
msgstr ""
"Ang mga key encryption key sa ibaba ay walang sinusuportahang buhay na silo. "
"Ang mga markadong ulila ang dapat aksyunan: wala na ang kanilang data at "
"nananatili ang mga susi sa KMS, na may gastos. Upang aksyunan ang isa, "
"piliin ito sa pahinang Key Encryption Keys at piliin ang schedule deletion, "
"restore, o itala ang aksyong ginawa sa KMS."

#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:237
msgid "KMS deletion"
msgstr "Pagbura sa KMS"

#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:260
msgid "Go to the Key Encryption Keys page →"
msgstr "Pumunta sa pahina ng Mga key encryption key →"

#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:267
msgid "Key Re-encryption Due"
msgstr "Dapat nang muling i-encrypt ang mga susi"

#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:269
msgid ""
"The data key needs to be re-encrypted after a KMS key rotation. Run 'python "
"manage.py reencrypt_keys' to move key encryption to the current version; no "
"data is touched."
msgstr ""
"Kailangang muling i-encrypt ang data key matapos ang pag-rotate ng susi sa "
"KMS. Patakbuhin ang 'python manage.py reencrypt_keys' upang ilipat ang pag-"
"encrypt ng susi sa kasalukuyang bersyon; walang data na ginagalaw."

#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:281
msgid "Wrapped by version"
msgstr "Nabalot ng bersyon"

#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:282
msgid "Last re-encrypted"
msgstr "Huling muling na-encrypt"

#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:302
msgid "Data Re-encryption Due"
msgstr "Dapat nang muling i-encrypt ang data"

#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:304
msgid ""
"The data key's own material is older than DEK_ROTATION_PERIOD_DAYS. Run "
"'python manage.py reencrypt_data' to re-encrypt a silo's data with new keys, "
"a computationally intensive process."
msgstr ""
"Mas luma na sa DEK_ROTATION_PERIOD_DAYS ang sariling material ng data key. "
"Patakbuhin ang 'python manage.py reencrypt_data' upang muling i-encrypt ang "
"data ng isang silo gamit ang mga bagong susi — isang mabigat na proseso sa "
"pagkukuwenta."

#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:316
msgid "Key material generated"
msgstr "Nabuo ang key material"

#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:336
msgid "Reconcile Findings"
msgstr "Mga natuklasan ng reconcile"

#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:339
msgid "Newly discovered keys (now tracked)"
msgstr "Mga bagong natuklasang key (sinusubaybayan na ngayon)"

#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:343
msgid "Confirmed deleted (gone from the KMS)"
msgstr "Nakumpirmang nabura (wala na sa KMS)"

#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:349
msgid ""
"Out of sync — still on the provider, should be gone. Their deletion date has "
"passed, so a provider deletion was canceled in the KMS, or failed. "
"Investigate on the provider:"
msgstr ""
"Hindi magkatugma — nasa provider pa rin gayong dapat wala na. Lumipas na ang "
"petsa ng pagbura, kaya kinansela sa KMS ang pagbura o nabigo ito. Suriin sa "
"provider:"

#: .\templates\admin\encryption_suite\reconcile_keys.html:359
msgid ""
"Out of sync — gone from the provider, no record of why. An active or "
"scheduled key vanished from the listing (deleted in the KMS). Record the "
"deletion on the Key Encryption Keys page to close it:"
msgstr ""
"Hindi magkatugma — wala na sa provider, walang talaan kung bakit. May aktibo "
"o nakaiskedyul na susing nawala sa listahan (binura sa KMS). Itala ang "
"pagbura sa pahina ng Key Encryption Keys para isara ito:"

